# MiladyOS ISO — Calamares installer session (D2 install-to-disk).
# calamares-settings-debian pulls calamares + rsync + cryptsetup + pkexec.
# Minimal X session (VT1, root autologin via the live-installer service);
# installed systems keep xorg+openbox as the thin desktop base.

# --- installer ---
calamares-settings-debian

# --- X session for the installer GUI ---
xserver-xorg
xserver-xorg-video-modesetting
xserver-xorg-video-qxl
xserver-xorg-video-fbdev
xserver-xorg-video-vesa
xserver-xorg-input-libinput
xinit
openbox
xterm
fonts-dejavu-core
